{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is just beginning on the planet <strong>Eieg\u00f4r</strong>, and you are its first spark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolized</strong> is an <strong>evolution-driven action-adventure RPG</strong> with a <strong>cycle-based</strong> structure. Begin as a fragile <strong>single cell</strong> and grow into powerful creatures as you fight to survive across distinct biomes and uncover why the world keeps starting over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat and consume other species to absorb their traits, unlocking <strong>mutations</strong> that change both your abilities and appearance. Your choices, where you travel, what you hunt, and what you consume shape how you move, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you fall at major events, <strong>a new cycle begins</strong>. The world reshapes, while your <strong>mutations and knowledge carry forward</strong>, letting you experiment with different builds and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four lineages, four ways to journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t assemble a creature from interchangeable parts. You <strong>commit to a lineage,</strong>\u00a0each with its own gameplay identity, movement style, combat approach, and strengths. In the Sanctuary\u2019s garden at the start of each cycle, you <strong>choose your lineage by consuming others</strong>, locking your form for that cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/8c7170bf4eac0aa63995f522363492d8.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/8c7170bf4eac0aa63995f522363492d8.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start microscopic and evolve into increasingly complex creatures within one of\u00a0<strong>four lineages</strong>\u00a0to define your core kit and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/240552bf1670de9b326f9743fc3e41a5.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/240552bf1670de9b326f9743fc3e41a5.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fixed set of crafted biomes that play differently every cycle, with new threats, paths, and emerging opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/c779c6a43a84921af2970f191bb8632f.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/c779c6a43a84921af2970f191bb8632f.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which biome to explore next and let its ecosystem influence your growth, opening new adaptations, tactics, and routes forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/3cd6ba656cfa886f20e9c4163aa94a10.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/3cd6ba656cfa886f20e9c4163aa94a10.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat and consume creatures to absorb their traits, unlocking mutations that alter your attacks, movement, and resistances, persisting across cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/171865c4a9007a180b413c50bef57e3b.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/171865c4a9007a180b413c50bef57e3b.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your evolving toolkit, face challenging alpha predators, and push further up the evolutionary ladder with each cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/52e52c54191fa42990ab594c6f2dc769.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/52e52c54191fa42990ab594c6f2dc769.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the Sanctuary between cycles to spend life force, unlock new options, upgrade structures, and prepare for deeper attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolized features a stylized mid\u2011poly look with a hand\u2011drawn charm, made for players who love exploration, progression, and the fantasy of shaping their own living, evolving creature.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435700?t=1767696816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435700?t=1767696816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/bd31068e954ed4c307ea409b7068ada9d2e3d9eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767696816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/bd31068e954ed4c307ea409b7068ada9d2e3d9eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767696816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is just beginning on the planet <strong>Eieg\u00f4r</strong>, and you are its first spark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolized</strong> is an <strong>evolution-driven action-adventure RPG</strong> with a <strong>cycle-based</strong> structure. Begin as a fragile <strong>single cell</strong> and grow into powerful creatures as you fight to survive across distinct biomes and uncover why the world keeps starting over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat and consume other species to absorb their traits, unlocking <strong>mutations</strong> that change both your abilities and appearance. Your choices, where you travel, what you hunt, and what you consume shape how you move, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you fall at major events, <strong>a new cycle begins</strong>. The world reshapes, while your <strong>mutations and knowledge carry forward</strong>, letting you experiment with different builds and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four lineages, four ways to journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t assemble a creature from interchangeable parts. You <strong>commit to a lineage,</strong>\u00a0each with its own gameplay identity, movement style, combat approach, and strengths. In the Sanctuary\u2019s garden at the start of each cycle, you <strong>choose your lineage by consuming others</strong>, locking your form for that cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/8c7170bf4eac0aa63995f522363492d8.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/8c7170bf4eac0aa63995f522363492d8.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start microscopic and evolve into increasingly complex creatures within one of\u00a0<strong>four lineages</strong>\u00a0to define your core kit and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/240552bf1670de9b326f9743fc3e41a5.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/240552bf1670de9b326f9743fc3e41a5.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fixed set of crafted biomes that play differently every cycle, with new threats, paths, and emerging opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/c779c6a43a84921af2970f191bb8632f.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/c779c6a43a84921af2970f191bb8632f.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which biome to explore next and let its ecosystem influence your growth, opening new adaptations, tactics, and routes forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/3cd6ba656cfa886f20e9c4163aa94a10.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/3cd6ba656cfa886f20e9c4163aa94a10.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat and consume creatures to absorb their traits, unlocking mutations that alter your attacks, movement, and resistances, persisting across cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/171865c4a9007a180b413c50bef57e3b.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/171865c4a9007a180b413c50bef57e3b.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your evolving toolkit, face challenging alpha predators, and push further up the evolutionary ladder with each cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/52e52c54191fa42990ab594c6f2dc769.avif?t=1767696816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/52e52c54191fa42990ab594c6f2dc769.webp?t=1767696816 width=1560 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the Sanctuary between cycles to spend life force, unlock new options, upgrade structures, and prepare for deeper attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolized features a stylized mid\u2011poly look with a hand\u2011drawn charm, made for players who love exploration, progression, and the fantasy of shaping their own living, evolving creature.</strong></p>","developers":["Infinity Branch Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/702d5fd2387282b809c37df4ffd0c6c0158062ea/header.jpg?t=1767696816","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Infinity Branch Studios . All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.aka